    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE INTRICATE MACHINING</h2>Traps are full of hidden secrets and interactions. Learn how they work and exploit your knowledge to deal maximum damage.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624400/extras/8947c519d1be4631fe1e00a57e73bf0b.poster.avif?t=1750452715\" width=620 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624400/extras/8947c519d1be4631fe1e00a57e73bf0b.webm?t=1750452715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624400/extras/8947c519d1be4631fe1e00a57e73bf0b.mp4?t=1750452715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN THE ENEMY</h2>The enemy is well prepared and has ways to counter your defenses. If you learn them, you may be able to counter their counter.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624400/extras/e4739ff200161ea0fa095e86c61f8581.poster.avif?t=1750452715\" width=620 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624400/extras/e4739ff200161ea0fa095e86c61f8581.webm?t=1750452715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2624400/extras/e4739ff200161ea0fa095e86c61f8581.mp4?t=1750452715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUELIKE ELEMENTS</h2>Explore procedurally-generated environments and defend them all \u2013 every arena has its own interactions and emphasizes certain strategies over others. Maybe you can even make the arena dispose of some enemies for you...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WATCH THE BUDGET</h2>Building traps takes gold, and the gold you have must be enough to defend several arenas \u2013 you need to watch how much you spend, or there won't be enough left for the next room.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING IS THE FUN</h2>Get in, build your defenses, watch a bit of suffering, and get out. The fun is building devious contraptions, and that's what you'll be doing the most.",
