h to defend several arenas \u2013 you need to watch how much you spend, or there won't be enough left for the next room.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILDING IS THE FUN</h2>Get in, build your defenses, watch a bit of suffering, and get out. The fun is building devious contraptions, and that's what you'll be doing the most.",
